# NOTE: constant/polyMesh IS deliberately tracked for every case, and must stay so.
# The meshes were exported from Pointwise V18.5R2 -- a licensed, interactive tool
# whose .pw project files are binary and cannot be scripted or regenerated here.
# The committed polyMesh is therefore the only reproducible artefact, and it is the
# substrate the regression golden is bound to. See docs/mesh.md.
#
# Rules of the form `constant/polyMesh/*` were previously listed here; because they
# contain a slash they anchor to the repository root and matched nothing under
# cases/*/, so they never had any effect (verify: `git check-ignore -v
# cases/3d-inflow/constant/polyMesh/points` exits 1). They have been removed rather
# than corrected, since the files should be tracked.

*.eMesh
constant/cellToRegion
*.OpenFOAM
*.csv
images/
img/
__pycache__/

# Generated OpenFOAM dictionaries -- emitted from case.yaml by plumetools, never
# hand-edited. Listed per active case rather than globbed, so that the archived
# cases' hand-written blockMeshDicts stay visibly tracked. See docs/mesh.md.
cases/3d-inflow/system/blockMeshDict

# Editor and tool artefacts
*.asv
*.orig

# Python environments and packaging
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
